[{"title":"杲和尚画赞","author":"王庭圭","text":"硉硉矹矹，如祝融太华，高不知其几千丈。\n轩轩轰轰，如惊雷唳鹤，声彻乎九天之上。\n道在真空，空即无相。\n以相求之，如盲摸象。\n乘机应物，河岳震响。\n眼如掣电，舌如奔浪。\n转大法轮，说无尽藏。\n当恁么时有识之者，个是径山杲和尚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5788,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鉴达观画像赞","author":"王庭圭","text":"寂然其容，万法不起。\n色固无求，不怒不喜。\n人自即之，其门如市。\n忽然探囊，辄起人死。\n本自无生，死亦何理。\n公能起之，如月在水。\n应物现形，本无作止。\n我复赞之，亦游戏耳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5789,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"路正卿画像赞","author":"王庭圭","text":"森然如千丈之长松，势若摩穹。\n昂然如野鹤之出笼，鸡群遂空。\n使之崛起，接翼鹓鸿。\n高冠大剑，立于庭中。\n七尺之躯，万夫之雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5790,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王修华画像赞","author":"王庭圭","text":"不冠不束，真被褐而怀玉。\n眼如曳电，光掣岩谷。\n不为燕颔虎头，万里飞而食肉。\n幅巾飘然，如五柳先生。\n宁终身为县令，而无求于世俗。\n挥麈尘埃之外，遗物离人，而立于独。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5791,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘大虚喜神赞","author":"王庭圭","text":"画无老幼，形全神守。\n颊上三毛，端逢妙手。\n少年角立，试辄不偶。\n不复掉鞅，名闻谷口。\n量陂千顷，才不论斗。\n今踰八十，年其逮耇。\n古人云用之则为公为卿，不用则山谷一叟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5792,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"英和尚赞","author":"王庭圭","text":"吉州英，铁作觜。\n莫贬眼，只这是。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5793,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏调义高","author":"王庭圭","text":"横担拄杖入山，坐断高峰境界。\n一吼震动林木，忽然草贼大败。\n了则万法俱空，未了应须还债。\n本是两重公案，如今一道俱解。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5794,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答王道之","author":"王庭圭","text":"云门至死不惺惺，居士仍蹉半月程。\n未省梦中重说梦，醉来添酒几时醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5795,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠侄孙行深","author":"王庭圭","text":"头陀未具山僧像，只欠钵囊挑锡杖。\n我今自是在家僧，汝好将钱买和尚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5796,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠度门僧 其一","author":"王庭圭","text":"眨起眉毛钟已成，不容著手勒钟铭。\n一铺岭上新功德，只欠将来点眼睛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5797,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠度门僧 其二","author":"王庭圭","text":"半夜钟声殷寺廊，吹螺打鼓助铮鏦。\n不妨白日开门睡，更遣阇梨饭后撞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5798,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祖麟作东山藏主以一偈送之","author":"王庭圭","text":"海藏龙宫五千卷，口角流涎方诵遍。\n不如烦此六丁神，一日与君推百转。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5799,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠行者悟本","author":"王庭圭","text":"出家未踏曹溪碓，且打吟峰寺里钟。\n寺有高僧善哮吼，莫将一物蕴心胸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5800,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和耿伯顺赠李居士","author":"王庭圭","text":"横担拄杖何许语，那个丛林无佛祖。\n但见阇梨夜不眠，衲被蒙头听粥鼓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5801,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李居士煎茶再次前韵赠之","author":"王庭圭","text":"东山寺里逢君语，问君何谓西来祖。\n鼻孔撩天唤不应，呼童汲水敲茶鼓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5802,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次韵呈智禅师","author":"王庭圭","text":"花药山中人解语，何必江西寻马祖。\n我亦会参铁觜师，如今不打这破鼓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5803,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登唐兴寺上方","author":"王庭圭","text":"三入唐兴寺里宿，闭门风雨云垂屋。\n今朝披雾立山椒，始识唐兴真面目。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5804,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"震禅师喜谈传灯录谩以一偈示之","author":"王庭圭","text":"僧问灵山一会禅，不知谁与佛言论。\n灵山会里何曾说，只有阇梨独得闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5805,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋楚老帖","author":"王庭圭","text":"佛固不可求，会处岂容说。\n苦作如是言，为谁略饶舌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5806,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哀挽诗","author":"王庭圭","text":"我家群从有封胡，潇洒如君更隐居。\n岂但开轩隐松竹，能令满屋贮图书。\n朱栏手植花犹在，黄叶风飘日已疏。\n触目自然堪痛哭，不胜清泪湿衣裾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5807,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又一首","author":"王庭圭","text":"曾看词锋战举场，弟兄旗鼓略相当。\n两贤方折月中桂，此老翻为地下郎。\n弟妹力携家数口，文章空费纸千张。\n广寒宫里丛生桂，何日飘来垄上芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5808,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妇人挽词","author":"王庭圭","text":"奔月姮娥魂已清，锦囊空贮诰封荣。\n穆家酥酪盈门贵，谢氏芝兰满砌生。\n风散采云吹碧落，霜飘寒菊堕红英。\n佳城万古凄凉地，陇水东流猿夜声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5809,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"王庭圭","text":"残花不待恶风吹，细雨浮花半出篱。\n篱外行人错回首，黄鹂飞上绿杨枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5810,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"王庭圭","text":"雪欲留君君不住，散作晴天送君去。\n沧江破腊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5811,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"王庭圭","text":"欲结茅斋一两间，芙蓉高处掩柴关。\n人逢好景。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5812,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"王庭圭","text":"江南一梦中，觉来说梦已无踪。\n会寻湘水枕上逢。\n逐客衣冠尚褴缕，故欲下非坚敌，试举酒兵令。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5813,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"王庭圭","text":"白银宫。\n断椽破壁宛积玉千顷，流水湾如月半弓。\n江边寒梅自奇绝，何必更画渔蓑翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5814,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"王庭圭","text":"鹭洲盘地轴，螺浦泻天津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5815,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"王庭圭","text":"江阔吞章贡，原长接广闽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5816,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"王庭圭","text":"残春铃阁无公事，来就酴醾放晚衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5817,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"王庭圭","text":"月影印仙迹，花香供笔灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5818,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送彭青老兼寄王民瞻","author":"圭悴中","text":"芒鞋竹杖西出关，行尽千山与万山。\n黄尘乌帽不埋没，丹霞选佛非选官。\n请君抬起幞头脚，向上犹有二四著。\n再拜更问王老师，老师规模难摸索。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5819,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菖蒲寺","author":"季陵","text":"飞泉一派木千章，九节蒲根涧里香。\n拔宅不留鸡与犬，至今无处问仙方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5820,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小尽行","author":"朱敦儒","text":"藤州三月作小尽，梧州三月作大尽。\n哀哉官历今不颁，忆昔升平泪成阵。\n我今何异桃源人，落叶为秋花作春。\n但恨未能与世隔，时闻丧乱空伤神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5821,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种芜菁作羹","author":"朱敦儒","text":"且喜芜菁种得成，苔心散出碧纵横。\n脆甜肭子无反恶，肥嫩恙儿不杀生。\n乐羊岂断儿孙念，刘季宁无父子情。\n争似野人茅屋下，日高澹煮一杯羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5822,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"历世","author":"朱敦儒","text":"面册面友风雨散，山鸟山花澹薄交。\n一榻氍毹容独卧，满盘杞菊是兼肴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5823,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五言","author":"朱敦儒","text":"天寒犹著絮，雨湿欲蒸书。\n吴地人情薄，西人客计疏。\n无书堪著眼，有法可安心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5824,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句二首 其一","author":"朱敦儒","text":"谁倚黄旗唤阿瞒，令君终作可怜人。\n萧然惟有鹿门老，不带孙刘一点尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5825,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句二首 其二","author":"朱敦儒","text":"轻阴小雨晚难收，柳瘦梅穷却似秋。\n可恨水仙花不语，无人共我说春愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5826,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春怨","author":"朱敦儒","text":"梨花雨送海棠风，不借胭脂作小红。\n几日无人吹玉笛，鸳鸯飞入馆娃宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5827,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"朱敦儒","text":"青罗包髻白行缠，不是凡人不是仙。\n家在洛阳城里住，卧吹铜笛过伊川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5828,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆旧","author":"朱敦儒","text":"早年京洛识前辈，晚景江湖无故人。\n难与儿童谈旧事，夜攀庭树数星辰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5829,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"朱敦儒","text":"试将天下照，万象总分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5830,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"朱敦儒","text":"岭外江数百，会此清远峡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5831,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"朱敦儒","text":"春林着雨绿自足，野水漾花红不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5832,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"朱敦儒","text":"解唱阳关别调声，前朝惟有李夫人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5833,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"朱敦儒","text":"几许少年春欲夏，一番梦事绿催红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5834,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"朱敦儒","text":"过时不语莺解事，怕客深藏鱼见机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5835,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"朱敦儒","text":"人间万事老无味，天下四时秋最愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5836,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"朱敦儒","text":"剪茅编鹤屋，筛米聚鸡粮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5837,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"朱敦儒","text":"灯昏鼠窥研，雨急犬穿篱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5838,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"朱敦儒","text":"但能闭户酌季雅，安用驭风寻伯昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5839,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"朱敦儒","text":"老鹤悔抛青嶂里，客星倦倚紫微边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5840,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"朱敦儒","text":"而今心服陶元亮，作得人间第一流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5841,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"朱敦儒","text":"佳人不耐冷，重叠著春衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5842,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题能仁寺壁","author":"马纯","text":"十年衰病卧林泉，鹓鹭群飞竞刺天。\n黄纸除书犹到汝，固知清世不遗贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5843,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"马纯","text":"勋业簿中频点检，只添白发与苍颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5844,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金钱花","author":"石懋","text":"名贵已居三品上，价高仍在五铢先。\n春来买断深红色，烧得人心似火燃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5845,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾","author":"石懋","text":"不传人间玉奁粉，别有天上金炉烟。\n独清合作诸兰佩，深白未数杨花绵。\n春风烂漫倚墙角，一月不复烧龙涎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5846,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"石懋","text":"苦无筋力太轻柔，何物如今得自由。\n带雨飘来成坠雪，捲春归去作飞球。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5847,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪","author":"石懋","text":"风云快约千丝雨，天地空无一点尘。\n晓树放开花意思，夜窗添起月精神。\n鹦鹉杯中未觉贫，寒凝酒面不成鳞。\n何如飞上参军鬓，与恼红楼歌舞人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5848,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除","author":"石懋","text":"索米长安久倦游，寂无杯盎洗牢愁。\n岁除借问除何事，除尽朱颜与黑头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5849,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡守","author":"石懋","text":"政成郛郭春千里，公退笙歌月一楼。\n犬吠花阴无旧警，麦翻云穗有新畴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5850,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生日","author":"石懋","text":"只应门闼悬弧际，正是乾坤和气中。\n寿语珠联千轴富，贺樽鲸吸百川空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5851,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长至 其一","author":"石懋","text":"阳和散逐管灰浮，节物那知人倦游。\n无可奈何霜后冷，急推不去眼中愁。\n康衢结束新裳杂，飞盖追随贺客稠。\n犹有祢衡漫一刺，侯门如海未容投。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5852,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长至 其二","author":"石懋","text":"笔墨如山宁疗饥，漫劳红日一丝迟。\n浊醪有理贫难醉，坐客无毡寒见欺。\n占岁丰凶云物动，漏春消息管灰知。\n江南梅使无恙否，肠断陇头花一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5853,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"石懋","text":"燕南雪花大于掌，冰柱悬檐一千丈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5854,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"石懋","text":"满身美荫抱高柳，问汝适从何处来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5855,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"石懋","text":"翻成缟带车迷路，卷上珠帘人倚楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5856,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"石懋","text":"浓开细细黄金蕊，间颇深深碧玉丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5857,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"石懋","text":"弯环浅水碧依旧，自在好花红渐新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5858,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"石懋","text":"欲问此根何处得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5859,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金州","author":"郭广和","text":"比年学校兴，礼义生于富。\n使节按部来，士子皆奔辏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5860,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临别诫弟子偈","author":"释净昭","text":"物外翛然获自由，殷勤诸子送他州。\n白云暂驻无方所，明月相随到处优。\n岩谷乍拖终勿思，林泉幽景岂回眸。\n吾今此去聊相别，汝且和光混众流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5861,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦中作","author":"江端本","text":"晚风残日下危楼，斜倚栏干满眼愁。\n休唱阳关催别酒，春情离恨总悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5862,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵子我兄和沈侍御史吴兴酬唱诗三首 其一","author":"江端本","text":"苕霅忆初泛，星霜今几周。\n芳莲霞比色，晚水月同游。\n未尽烟波赏，先惊岁月遒。\n风尘今满眼，遥想芰荷秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5863,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵子我兄和沈侍御史吴兴酬唱诗三首 其二","author":"江端本","text":"宇宙烟尘日，谁何风马牛。\n掀天怒翼倦，卷地骇奔流。\n黩武非天意，穷凶与鬼谋。\n风波方治渺，何处可维舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5864,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵子我兄和沈侍御史吴兴酬唱诗三首 其三","author":"江端本","text":"四野传烽急，中原杀气浮。\n游鱼惊过艇，风叶乱鸣鹙。\n宿雾藏文豹，寒浮露远洲。\n无心谋出处，知命复何忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5865,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送人","author":"江端本","text":"年衰岁晚有谁从，井臼无人伴敬通。\n当户秋山横积翠，拥阶霜叶委残红。\n倦游自笑裘先敝，赴敌谁知甲已衷。\n看取功名垂竹帛，不须咄咄更书空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":5866,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]